# EXPERIMENTS.md — what may fail in <PROJECT>, and what happens when it does

This file exists because **a team that may only use the agent when it is sure things will go well
does not learn to use it: it learns to hide when it did.**

It is not a tool policy. It is what this team agreed, with a name and a date, so that the
permission still exists the week after the first pull request that went badly.

