## What this file is not

- **Not an unlimited permission.** Section 2 is as much part of the agreement as section 1.
- **Not a shield.** That something was permitted does not make the outcome good; it makes it safe
  to talk about.
- **Not paperwork.** Nobody signs anything here, and no CI check requires it. An agreement that
  becomes a checkbox gets ticked unread.
